          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Rakesh’s Puzzle: A Number Game"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.367,
            0.595,
            0.438
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Rakesh gives you a challenge. “I have thought of two numbers”, he says. “Their "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "sum is 25",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", and their "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "difference is 11",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ".”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.451,
            0.492,
            0.473
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Can you tell me the two numbers?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.477,
            0.846,
            0.514
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "You don’t need to use any formulas. Just try different pairs of numbers and then check:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.515,
            0.537,
            0.534
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Do the two numbers add up to 25?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.535,
            0.545,
            0.553
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Is the difference between them 11?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.552,
            0.793,
            0.593
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(Remember: the difference means first number – second number.) Write your guesses like this:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.602,
            0.844,
            0.736
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.156,
                0.602,
                0.844,
                0.736
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_0_table_11.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>First Number</td><td>Second Number</td><td>Sum</td><td>Difference</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>15</td><td>25</td><td>-5</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>5</td><td>25</td><td>15</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>6</td><td>25</td><td>13</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>7</td><td>25</td><td>11</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.746,
            0.422,
            0.77
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Did you find the right pair?"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.783,
            0.846,
            0.824
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Now that you’ve found the correct pair, Rakesh gives you a second challenge:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.833,
            0.829,
            0.853
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "“Think of two numbers whose "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "sum is 25",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ", but their "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "difference is –11",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": ".”"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.858,
            0.847,
            0.898
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Use the same method. Try different pairs of numbers and fill in the table again. You will notice that if you swap the numbers from the first"
            }
